  "title": "0b. Operational-level MDO: the Suwalki Gap (notional)",
  "about": "Notional blue force holds the corridor between Suwalki, Augustow, Lazdijai and Marijampole against a notional red force pressing from the western and south-eastern flanks. Two-sided GNSS jamming from masts squeezes the corridor; an L-band barrage targets Link 16; airborne ES on both sides out-hear ground ES. Blue HQ nets hop across 30-88 MHz. Public geography only; forces, frequencies and values are notional. Use multi-select to compare, for example, both red GNSS jammers against the blue fires and UAV.",
  "centre": [54.15, 22.95],
